{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMANOMALY\u00a0</strong>is a mix between whodunnit mystery and horror game, with different randomly selected culprit each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title is a portmanteau of <strong>Coma<i>\u00a0</i></strong><i>(state of deep unconsciousness)</i> and <strong>Anomaly\u00a0</strong><i>(abnormalities)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our demo is frequently updated, so check often, or click the <strong>follow</strong> / <strong>wishlist</strong> button above to be informed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/ac903af571d21d6127502ce5b32a1696.avif?t=1771768859\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0It's 1985.\u00a0You are <strong>Susi</strong>, a nurse working for <strong>Sudaritra Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a very wealthy and powerful patient was admitted to the hospital with weird symptoms and peculiar conditions: <strong>Reynald Suroso</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\u2695\ufe0f A family doctor.<br>\ud83d\udd2e A family &quot;spiritual guide&quot;.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f A backstabbing family member, trying to kill the patient.<br><br>What could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Play COMANOMALY, and your tasks will be\u00a0:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Examine the <strong>anomalies</strong> left by mystical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Find <strong>notes</strong> left by the doctor and the shaman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Check the <strong>life support machine</strong> and mark abnormal medical symptoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Pay attention to <strong>dialogues</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and the <strong>environment</strong> to uncover the culprit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Try to get the <strong>best possible completion time</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>COMANOMALY is still in active development</strong>. As such, many aspects of the demo are not final and may change in the future. If you find a bug, or if there are parts of the game you don\u2019t enjoy, please let us know so we can improve its quality.\u00a0\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR: Game is still in development; suggestions are very welcome.</strong>\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/5c04ab09c9731f34b0de2d7c3456b49b.avif?t=1771768859\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u00a0 : A, S, W, D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint\u00a0 : Shift (while moving)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look\u00a0: Move Mouse\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action\u00a0:\u00a0 E</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue\u00a0 :\u00a0 R / Left mouse click\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu / Pause (in-game)\u00a0 :\u00a0 F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Intro\u00a0 :\u00a0 F (hold)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/7b63f49a60d2c3ea09dd4363001429bf.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/7b63f49a60d2c3ea09dd4363001429bf.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/7b63f49a60d2c3ea09dd4363001429bf.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e15d222cff0b4e45178e5e632bf6b362.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e15d222cff0b4e45178e5e632bf6b362.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e15d222cff0b4e45178e5e632bf6b362.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921560?t=1771768859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/c35a8b7fc2bbd104398fa23ebd420fe19abfc13b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771768859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/ea99715f507de3990b208c92ed880c1add41cc45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771768859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/ea99715f507de3990b208c92ed880c1add41cc45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771768859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3938930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMANOMALY\u